      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احكأ</span></b> , (Sh, S, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أِحْكَآءٌ</span>; (TA;) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَكَأَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَكَاَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَكْءٌ</span>; (TA;) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احتكأ</span></b> ; (K;) <i>He tightened</i> a knot; (S, K;)
<i>made</i> it <i>firm:</i> (Sh, TA:) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احكى</span> (S) and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَكَى</span>. (S and K in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حكى</span>.) [See a verse of
'Adee Ibn-Zeyd cited voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُلْبٌ</span>.] ＝   
